[workspace]
-> members => [source-code/cli, source-code/tui, source-code/gui]
-> mode    => standard

[commands]
-> check
--> run => bit ws check
--> description => Type-check every member
-> clean
--> run => bit ws clean
--> description => Remove the shared cache/
-> frontend
--> run => cd source-code/gui && bit frontend
--> description => Build the GUI front-end (TypeScript + Solid.js) into source-code/gui/frontend/dist
